#
# Model unit tests (WI-1.453). Catch2's CHECK/REQUIRE macros expand to branches, so a test case trips
# readability-function-cognitive-complexity on code that has almost no control flow of its own. Count only the
# test's own branches.
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity.IgnoreMacros: true
